Package: flippies-sharedfiles
Version: 1.2
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Create Flippies <flippies@deb.flip>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, python3-tk
Description: Browse and download the world's shared files
 Shared files shows the folders and files a Minecraft world shares through its
 localfilesys folder (http://localfilesys.com/ on the network modem) and
 downloads them to ~/Downloads.
